    atomics: simplify (cmp)xchg() instrumentation
    =

    So long as we can choose a suitably unique name for the pointer used by
    the atomic instrumentation, there's no need to have a C wrapper,
    complete with switching on the size of the pointer type.
    =

    So let's simplify things, and get rid of the C wrappers.
